{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "b25865d6f52df7c372f316097dc26a15f386c4f602d8ce9915137a6d3506006a", "ja": "スイートホーム", "zh": "甜蜜的家", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "fd3385108793b0628d52b1171522778b555455f92509d183e24d4c9130c6241c", "ja": "公演を成功させたリコッタのメンバーは、打\nち上げで遊園地に遊びに来た。5人はお互い\nを尊重し、思いやりながら休日を満喫する。\n強い絆を結び合い、リコッタは家族のような\nユニットになったのだった。", "zh": "顺利完成公演的『Ricotta』成员们，\n来到游乐园举行庆功宴。\n五个人互相尊重，为彼此着想，\n度过了开心的假日。大家缔结了深厚的情谊，\n让『Ricotta』成为一个像是家人一样的团体。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4fb2eec61e834fbe99fb175e7c5cb52baaf32dc5b066410ebaae34938d4ba858", "ja": "（リコッタのステージは、無事に終わった。\nお客さん達も、きっと楽しんでくれていたと思う）", "zh": "（『Ricotta』的表演顺利结束，\n观众们一定也看得很开心。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "84b2ad0398632268b3cf51876a907a61b86b99ed06d3a0bedf98c66a39b70c1f", "ja": "（今日は、ライブの打ち上げ……\nメンバーのリクエストで、遊園地に来ている）", "zh": "（今天是演唱会的庆功宴……\n应成员要求，来游乐园玩。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "c88f9a76969335d06706a6be9bb7f22a8bda4a33bf27bbc31a65c0fc46f49a0c", "ja": "遊園地の目玉といえばジェットコースターでしょ！\n一番激しいやつ、3回は乗りたいよね！", "zh": "说到游乐园的重头戏就是云霄飞车了！\n真想把最激烈的云霄飞车坐个三轮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "0118424a59c5a4f966ebdedca1081b5d245d7188e8f0abeb2ddf8bde30c6e025", "ja": "私はオバケ屋敷行ってみたいわ～。\nここのんメッチャ怖いんやって！", "zh": "我想去看看鬼屋～\n听说这边的鬼屋非常恐怖呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "ad9f3d787dcfa420f3b7160ccc4e56383cc841cc6b19318042b98bb83dff8521", "ja": "私は、何がいいかな～…？　あっ、そうそう！\nお弁当作ってきたから、あとでみんなで食べようね♪", "zh": "我要玩什么好呢……？啊，对了！\n我做了便当，待会大家一起吃吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "2199c521217532d9a6b36570c39f8b57051c4ee4710cccc872faf69090817fc7", "ja": "は、は、春香さんの手作り弁当～～～っ！！？\nそそそそそそそんな、お宝じゃないですか……！？", "zh": "春、春、春香亲手做的便当～～～！！？\n那那那那那那那不就是宝物吗……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "6a08b61cd05d0d7c2541fee9d4582a94b9ec812155343040ec4d1af8463cbd45", "ja": "食べるなんてそんな、もったいない！\nありさ、保存して帰りますーっ！！！", "zh": "吃掉太可惜了！\n亚利沙要把它保存起来带回家！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "97dd497eb1cf387d7fca40fb45fc806b23934e00270f1e2252929049ebbbba1e", "ja": "あはは……。傷んじゃうから、食べてね？", "zh": "哈哈……这样食物会坏掉的，还是吃掉吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b437a1da1490a2551001813d64e965db4a1b93684fc66370c7a150e6108057db", "ja": "桃子は、どの乗り物に乗りたいんだ？\nさっきからずっと見てる観覧車か？", "zh": "桃子想坐什么游乐设施？\n是你从刚刚就一直盯着看的摩天轮吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "8b3a4089a7ec6189ee9261bb8ede4402d6e1f8518529d11690faeec05611a4dc", "ja": "え？\nべ、別に桃子、観覧車に乗りたいなんて言って……。", "zh": "咦？桃、桃子才没有说想搭摩天轮……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "abbce76df0ab4c25a7e56833e23fa2ea55e8d3946d03afdf3329f95ae0861263", "ja": "よーしっ！　決まりや決まり！\n最初のアトラクションは、観覧車にけってーい！", "zh": "好──！就这样决定啦！\n第一个游乐设施就去搭摩天轮啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "059b3a1ae71be0878717942bb2a59ec983051ce35b7d04de673ec5aac84412c9", "ja": "そっか、桃子が行きたいならそうしよっか！\nなんたって、指導係として一番頑張ってたんだしね♪", "zh": "这样啊，桃子想坐的话我们就去坐那个吧！\n毕竟桃子身为小老师，比大家都还要更努力♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "241621c8789ce1bed900117b05494c067132bc9720a8a87e1e60c6c3ca8722d8", "ja": "も、もう！　奈緒さん、のり子さん！？\n桃子、行きたいなんて言ってないのに……。", "zh": "等、等一下！奈绪姊、法子姊！？\n桃子才没有说想坐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "54f9f417f5458217364bec6a3040535443d420630aa4d2280ddb8769e44386bb", "ja": "あっ……この観覧車、定員2名だって。\nみんな、どうしよう？", "zh": "啊……这个摩天轮一个车厢只能坐两个人。\n大家要怎么办呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "ad9646ed986fd7512e0357301979371cfd1e175850c0c837469591b6e207c6a6", "ja": "んじゃ、組分け決めよ！\n{$P$}入れて、ちょうど6人だしね♪", "zh": "那就分组吧！\n加上{$P$}刚好有六个人♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "ee887a72f83d7bdb6d44de4ebb22ea08fc2f3313e05cf72fd8f8aa879659db18", "ja": "んじゃ、私はのり子でええわ。", "zh": "那我只好选法子啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "379115cf852e6beb9477aae58aa1964c4ec9bdc7dc60fc7c4326ec5b68f0154e", "ja": "こら、「のり子でいい」って何？　失礼な！", "zh": "喂，「只好选法子」是什么意思？真没礼貌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "1c01fdaacacd1fe752ca784973d8dc0de0ff161be4477c916b8fedb048e96fe1", "ja": "桃子は春香さんと行くから、亜利沙さん、\nお兄ちゃんと乗ってきたら？", "zh": "桃子要跟春香姊一起坐，\n亚利沙姊，你跟大哥哥一起坐吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "36993ac1817379d46a9f0bfa673933e5d6cceac4986cc106e37fc850965e4709", "ja": "ふえっ！？\n……あ、ありさが、{$P$}さんと！？", "zh": "欸！？\n……亚、亚利沙跟{$P$}先生一起！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "795386bd19059265a903148bdb009e44470100180c7f8d32cc52b0514dba244f", "ja": "それじゃ、お兄ちゃん？\n亜利沙さんのこと、よろしくね！", "zh": "那大哥哥，\n亚利沙姊就交给你啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1020_p", "source_sha256": "dac3cf9639d97a1373f040dc77b649332410a0186f88ae3f8baed10e381e6879", "ja": "え？　おい、桃子……まぁいいか。\nよし、亜利沙、行こうか。", "zh": "咦？喂，桃子……算了。\n好，亚利沙，我们上去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "f716e6a984c7427439d4f1b47c5cc82dffa9d7b0a09270a7fe6f2e20ef9496d5", "ja": "は、はい……！", "zh": "好、好的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "2329235d2179625a8f2c1db0cb41c18a1e4caeb3411f8e826556e126dd8216c6", "ja": "お、おお～……。観覧車、\n動き出しましたね、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "喔、喔喔……\n摩天轮开始动了耶，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1023_p", "source_sha256": "843028e440bc068e33272f7cda43935b68e692cc403e78884a96b1b13425ab11", "ja": "そうだな。ところで亜利沙、\n春香か桃子と観覧車に乗りたかったんじゃないか？", "zh": "对呀。话说回来，亚利沙，\n你不是想跟春香或桃子一起搭摩天轮吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1024_028ari", "source_sha256": "5efe2cef50ac3819af111f2d619b00d0b7504008bee30ba60c0f57f38009e468", "ja": "えっ！？　いえ、そんなコトはありますけど、\nおふたりのどちらかを選ぶなんて、不可能ですし！", "zh": "咦！？不是的，虽然亚利沙有这样想，\n但是要亚利沙在她们两人之中选一个人是不可能的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1025_p", "source_sha256": "668e5eb9eb1d174d372ffe19af06f02103678dff5e6c0b3c4181c9125a74ac0e", "ja": "そ、そうか。\n選択すること自体が無理なんだな……。", "zh": "这、这样啊。\n光是选择这件事本身就有困难啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1026_028ari", "source_sha256": "3f94705c77c04077bc1ef451abb59de399d545ea1c6f3578583030283b5f0467", "ja": "それに、{$P$}さんと\n観覧車に乗れるのも、とっても嬉しいっていうか……！", "zh": "而且能跟{$P$}先生搭摩天轮，\n亚利沙也非常开心……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1027_028ari", "source_sha256": "6932028ea06d735bded079a2c52a5fe3b1b4dbef713a139295310a6f297ee8bd", "ja": "な、なんだか、改めて言うと照れちゃいますね？\nエヘヘ……♪", "zh": "总、总觉得特地把这种事说出口还真不好意思。\n嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1028_p", "source_sha256": "2a3fd81d4a41893a35d7298c6dff8bbfbc5be13afba72538fb43ccfa5f1a016a", "ja": "まぁ、亜利沙がガッカリしてないならよかったよ。", "zh": "好吧，亚利沙没有觉得失望就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1029_028ari", "source_sha256": "7c91528bae67353dcdf157ac7c4646667240f14c4243a1cf3461a35d592b3e25", "ja": "ガッカリなんて、するはずがありませんっ！\nありさの{$P$}さんですからね！", "zh": "怎么可能会觉得失望呢！\n你可是亚利沙的{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1030_028ari", "source_sha256": "6b16971014a5b67ae90804702dd7fce12a03a5ace1f0498b7f75d90f950298fb", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\n今回は本当に、ありがとうございました。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n这次真的很谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1031_028ari", "source_sha256": "8b013401038e2539b7c931bb005e4d3f06093aa24cbf2ed558e6a8e57c33c266", "ja": "ありさがリコッタのみんなと仲良くできたのは、\n{$P$}さんのおかげです♪", "zh": "亚利沙可以跟『Ricotta』的大家感情这么好，\n都是托{$P$}先生的福♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1032_p", "source_sha256": "fb3b7367a254a515795b4a60954b6888b609677be8e51c23381627252be158c0", "ja": "それは……どうだろうな。誰かと仲良くなれるか\nどうかは、当人同士次第だと思うけど。", "zh": "这个……可就难说啰。\n我认为感情能否变得要好，还是要看当事人彼此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1033_p", "source_sha256": "d6b91aababf7de16a154b7ba55299586f2b1a580d91ab74004ebebd7032f8fb7", "ja": "みんなが亜利沙を見て、仲良くしたいと思った。\nそれだけだよ。", "zh": "大家看到亚利沙，觉得想跟你做朋友。\n就只是这样而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1034_028ari", "source_sha256": "a0080fff7ee593ea4d04e0a690c10f489c7dc8793f8b74587abc8ecb58ecf6e0", "ja": "エヘへ……。でも、キッカケをくれたのは……。", "zh": "嘿嘿……不过帮亚利沙制造机会的还是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1035_028ari", "source_sha256": "f6c210de210cb6d5de69660011807df220fc469893b1aa69bfe7d95fae60f5ac", "ja": "あの、ありさ、リコッタでお友達ができちゃいました。\nあっ、お友達だけじゃなくて、仲間ですね！", "zh": "那个，亚利沙在『Ricotta』交到朋友了。\n啊，不只是朋友，应该是伙伴才对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1036_028ari", "source_sha256": "84f227d6eb928745ee39dec2c204528f64acdeb992b53da206c91f3902f3371b", "ja": "アイドルちゃんのお友達で仲間なんて、\n最高です～っ！", "zh": "可以成为偶像宝贝的朋友和伙伴，\n真是太棒了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1037_p", "source_sha256": "e279221fa03c992986cdb63ee6358a6d18e1124c642c92de2ea1c7d6e8b970fb", "ja": "こ、こら、急に立ちあがったら危ないぞ！？\n……亜利沙ー！", "zh": "喂、喂！突然站起来很危险的！\n……亚利沙──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1038_043nor", "source_sha256": "9666253eed931fd6f413143aedcc64665730105137fbd7619a70ae10151c5373", "ja": "あ～～っ、楽しかったっ！　ジェットコースター3周、\n付き合ってくれてありがとね、みんな♪", "zh": "啊～～好开心！\n谢谢大家陪我一起坐了三次云霄飞车♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1039_037nao", "source_sha256": "4b39bfb3b9cd99b2ce08725edea086f23f06421221c64962c3bcb907d3cb4091", "ja": "いや、3周はさすがに目回ったわ～……\n{$P$}さん、お昼にしません？", "zh": "坐三次真的太多了，我眼睛都花啦……\n{$P$}先生，要不要来吃午餐呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1040_p", "source_sha256": "66334479ec8171df1ae60fc1782fcb13206b32706aa29c7636ce2a22194563d5", "ja": "そ、そうだな……うっぷ。", "zh": "也、也是呢……呜恶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1041_001har", "source_sha256": "62d0761345380f86b3e7013063c07f42811e0cdef24cb7a0bd90462c9936e9db", "ja": "ようやく私のお弁当の出番かな？\nロッカーに預けてあるから、取ってきますね♪", "zh": "终于轮到我做的便当出场了。\n便当在寄物柜里，我去拿一下♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1042_028ari", "source_sha256": "f611a0182692fcd6d762140ae11aff47b5c3da7dd8aacb2e092ac61554332676", "ja": "ありさは、場所取り行ってきます！\n一番いい場所を確保してきますからね～っ！", "zh": "亚利沙去占位置！\n亚利沙会占到最棒的位置的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1043_043nor", "source_sha256": "201d114994ea9846e7f0ebd921d8e1ed74aa25f7351d595de7388aba17d2ba94", "ja": "んじゃアタシは飲み物を買ってこようかな？\n奈緒、行くよ！", "zh": "那我去买饮料吧，\n奈绪，走了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1044_037nao", "source_sha256": "bd7c72e546dbd08282265ee8050dfcf82a36a00b8723009f27474009dc7d69fe", "ja": "任せて～。みんなの好みもわかってるし、\nええ感じの飲み物買うてくるわ。", "zh": "交给我啦～我知道大家的喜好，\n会买感觉不错喝的饮料回来的啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1045_p", "source_sha256": "bfc56b426bc2de302df785aea399868a1c4875113b0ee2f07e23512212c5826a", "ja": "飲み物は重いだろう？　俺が行くよ。", "zh": "饮料很重吧？我去就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1046_043nor", "source_sha256": "338700760509e0fb665d403a156fc3749fbef67fb5882c9e605da153b154d104", "ja": "いいから、{$P$}はここにいて。\nねっ？　それじゃ、いってきまーす♪", "zh": "不用啦，{$P$}留在这里就好。\n那我们走啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1047_049mom", "source_sha256": "ade8b4d5b848bb898ab361fe2a7549b2afe90c2315f1309c1f5faba5667eef6f", "ja": "桃子は……えっと、なにしたらいい？", "zh": "那桃子……呃，桃子要做什么才好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1048_043nor", "source_sha256": "50d8e4c825f888996b340ab3a06f09d4e810159e3fa786fa0f70a8073a84aedb", "ja": "桃子は、{$P$}とここで待ってて。\nみんなが戻ってきた時、誰もいなかったら困るでしょ。", "zh": "桃子就跟{$P$}一起留在这里。\n不然大家回来的时候，要是都没人不是很麻烦吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1049_049mom", "source_sha256": "bf1fd1686147f72fe57d6f5c7b5f423ea866b5b66456ad377b91f75b1b6ac005", "ja": "わかった。\nじゃあみんな、行ってらっしゃい！", "zh": "桃子知道了。\n那大家请慢走！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1050_p", "source_sha256": "cbb4c2546d2858b3401ae9d86b2fe6c9fb7cf2ce6ce1d9f62bf08c93d82341c0", "ja": "気をつけてな！", "zh": "要注意安全喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1051_p", "source_sha256": "a4343cb22a88741950736ebf8dcf3eee3cf4d243c71f3e5e235d33e242ac9c31", "ja": "桃子。さっきは観覧車、楽しかったか？", "zh": "桃子，刚刚搭摩天轮好玩吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1052_049mom", "source_sha256": "334d933736b41be639f215e9e9a5b6766ef8c719424d9d34383c034abe3b69ae", "ja": "楽しかったよ！　春香さんに、\nアイドルの仕事の話をたくさん聞いたよ。", "zh": "很好玩！\n桃子听春香姊聊了很多偶像的工作秘辛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1053_049mom", "source_sha256": "db545b7a92932a3b83ebccec5bd00bceda0230ec00fcee79f8f954f02398798f", "ja": "だから桃子も、いろいろ話したんだ。\n役作りのこととか、リコッタのみんなのこととか……。", "zh": "所以桃子也聊了很多话题，\n像是揣摩角色，还有『Ricotta』成员们的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1054_049mom", "source_sha256": "22a9a22bd5f98012bc93c9ab7f845c77d1c955c821acd57af4702c0f7125cff5", "ja": "ねえ、お兄ちゃん。観覧車に乗る時、どうして桃子が、\n亜利沙さんと乗ってって言ったか、わかる？", "zh": "大哥哥，你知道为什么搭摩天轮的时候，\n桃子要你跟亚利沙姊一起吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1055_p", "source_sha256": "4c41930f2a3a7b9ed9a516c81a281ce5af0d1fee90f47d85a32778eb92dc8a29", "ja": "うーん……どうしてなんだ？", "zh": "嗯……为什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1056_049mom", "source_sha256": "fdd677b8bda01dd5feaffc71c41316dcbabc76c9e6505efaa0a7effe1195148a", "ja": "……桃子ね。あの時、本当は桃子が、\n亜利沙さんと一緒に乗りたいって言うつもりだったの。", "zh": "……桃子当时啊，本来想说的是\n「桃子想跟亚利沙姊一起坐」。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1057_p", "source_sha256": "7d939b9fa10dc7c1a00bb64a81b7adbcaadb8bf159d6a7ecf3c63681b2ea2004", "ja": "なんだ、そうだったのか？", "zh": "什么嘛，是这样啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1058_049mom", "source_sha256": "4f199cdf03717374c5fa606e7440a07928a848c180530558b8ac4d59c30a5885", "ja": "うん。桃子、リコッタのレッスンで亜利沙さんに、\n迷惑かけたから……2人きりで話したかったんだ。", "zh": "嗯，桃子因为『Ricotta』的训练课程，\n给亚利沙姊添了麻烦……所以想跟她单独聊聊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1059_049mom", "source_sha256": "3305af7cd20715b4936fd3d491c4b97ea56c22642297d919bd7dd8f05d481088", "ja": "でも、いざ言おうと思ったら、うまく言えなくて。\n……ごめんね、お兄ちゃん。", "zh": "但是话到嘴边却又没办法好好说出口。\n……抱歉，大哥哥。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1060_p", "source_sha256": "275770dfa1b8c731fd751b1768c354b988ebedb390b78a4453a175dc27716cff", "ja": "そうだったのか……。", "zh": "原来是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1061_p", "source_sha256": "83708d0af2d6bea4c34104708fd5d8c03c5669b069968d353c29ba10b1a66022", "ja": "なぁ、桃子。そのこと、今からでも\n亜利沙に話したら、すごく喜ぶと思うぞ。", "zh": "桃子，这件事情就算现在跟亚利沙说，\n我想她还是会非常开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1062_049mom", "source_sha256": "4840e24ecfd8fa7896dd908457f6cb4cbdfbb5386a79e72b024a122881cb8564", "ja": "えっ……そ、そうかな？　でも亜利沙さんは、\n桃子と2人になんてなりたくないかも……。", "zh": "咦……是、是这样吗？\n但是亚利沙姊应该不会想跟桃子独处……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1063_p", "source_sha256": "b19bfe58a3622795293639edbdc9cba59252acc42a5fce8b611c78a9525aadd9", "ja": "うーん。俺が観覧車で聞いた限りでは、\n全力で2人になりたそうだったけどな？", "zh": "嗯～根据我在摩天轮里听到的，\n她好像非常想跟你单独相处喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1065_p", "source_sha256": "d1f805d7446b7ba3c4ae7e0cb33aab8540195b7154aa80e7901bf6576d0da639", "ja": "お昼を食べたら、また観覧車に乗ろうか。\n次はまた、違う組み合わせで乗ればいい。", "zh": "吃过午餐之后再去搭一次摩天轮吧。\n到时候再跟不同的人一组就行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1066_049mom", "source_sha256": "5239564b699a088d45ddeb30755c53cc0539e0be8d922c3fb2ed465fd735f4a6", "ja": "お兄ちゃん……。\nうん。みんなにお願いしてみるね。", "zh": "大哥哥……\n嗯，桃子去拜托大家看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1067_049mom", "source_sha256": "e3c6d7dab836efd3a2c6af92da2ad46c6cb9a9db63b144fc3b6439d04ff295f3", "ja": "……あ。\nみんな戻ってきたね。", "zh": "……啊，\n大家回来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1068_001har", "source_sha256": "7620092a8b84b3769f25d3c22e6e11404dbd5f63e196ee9cee2a9b24d0926ffc", "ja": "桃子ちゃん、{$P$}さん、ただいま！\nお弁当持ってきたよ♪", "zh": "桃子、{$P$}先生，我回来了！\n我拿便当来了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1069_043nor", "source_sha256": "cf34ac2b1786790c5d1e8a77d0a683053b5502634b87440618386d469fe68452", "ja": "たっだいま～！\nお茶とオレンジジュース、買ってきたよ！", "zh": "我们回来了～！\n我们买了茶跟柳橙汁喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1070_037nao", "source_sha256": "9cc0a1d7682cdff9647f10683c7f68d025bd50449a47726fc6670f7b07b24640", "ja": "ついでに、たこ焼きと唐揚げとポテトも買うてきたで！\nみんなでつまもう♪", "zh": "我们还顺便买了章鱼烧、炸鸡和洋芋片嘿！\n大家一起吃吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0018_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_07_1071_028ari", "source_sha256": "48c09d2a1cc9a5f7fe8dbe5d2bfc1fd38fc201b566a11f1de275fcefeaf2906f", "ja": "桃子ちゃんセンパイ、ありさ、やりましたっ！\nとびきりの場所を確保してきましたよ～！", "zh": "小桃前辈，亚利沙成功了！\n亚利沙占了一个绝佳的位置～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
